{"id":"4869eb031373ed3e","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-thm-girsanov.md","title":"Girsanov Theorem","display":"thm-girsanov — Girsanov Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-girsanov","aliases":["58-thm-girsanov"],"display":"thm-girsanov — Girsanov Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-girsanov.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-girsanov"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-girsanov</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-girsanov — Girsanov Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"98b9feb035179dfc\" href=\"?note=98b9feb035179dfc\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-girsanov.md\">../batch20/58-df-girsanov.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb Q,W,W^{\\mathbb Q},\\theta,Z,T\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb Q,W,W^{\\mathbb Q},\\theta,Z,T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GirsanovTransform}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{GirsanovTransform}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"98b9feb035179dfc\" href=\"?note=98b9feb035179dfc\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-girsanov.md\">../batch20/58-df-girsanov.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}girsanov}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GirsanovTransform}_S(\\mathbb Q,Z,W^{\\mathbb Q};\\mathbb P,W,\\theta,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T)\n\\to\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(W^{\\mathbb Q},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}girsanov}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GirsanovTransform}_S(\\mathbb Q,Z,W^{\\mathbb Q};\\mathbb P,W,\\theta,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T)\n\\to\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(W^{\\mathbb Q},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The theorem projects the Brownian conclusion from the canonical finite-horizon Girsanov data, preserving its filtration, density process, sign convention, and measure-space parameters.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-girsanov.md","status":"resolved","id":"98b9feb035179dfc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-girsanov.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-girsanov.md","status":"resolved","id":"98b9feb035179dfc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GirsanovTransform}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch20/58-df-girsanov.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb Q,W,W^{\\mathbb Q},\\theta,Z,T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GirsanovTransform}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}girsanov}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GirsanovTransform}_S(\\mathbb Q,Z,W^{\\mathbb Q};\\mathbb P,W,\\theta,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T)\n\\to\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(W^{\\mathbb Q},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb Q).","display":true}],"bytes":968,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4183","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-thm-girsanov.md|58-thm-girsanov]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["98b9feb035179dfc"]}